  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">ETFs im Rampenlicht - <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/lars-reichel?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Lars Reichel</a> spricht in der neuen Podcast-Folge mit seinen Gästen auf dem PortfolioAward in München über ausgezeichnete ETFs.

Der Dank für die O-Töne geht an <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/chris-hofmann-9a0b6911?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Chris Hofmann</a> von <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/vanguard?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Vanguard</a>, an <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/christin-r%C3%B6lz-01aa87203?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Christin Rölz</a> von <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/company/stock3?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>stock3 AG</a>, <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/tobias-kramer-berlin?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Tobias Kramer</a> und <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/daniela-helemann-ba7657318?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Daniela Helemann</a> vom Veranstalter <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/company/dzb-media?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>DZB Media</a>, an <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/robert-ertl-50a10148?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Robert Ertl</a> von <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/company/gettex?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>gettex exchange</a>, <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/lukas-nistler-0805a0127?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Lukas Nistler</a> von <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/ishares/?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>iShares</a> und an  <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/carsten-l%C3%BCtke-bornefeld-4126a5b8?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Carsten Lütke-Bornefeld</a>. 
Neue Investment-Ideen findet ihr auf der Website des PortfolioAwards, die vorgestellten ETFs sind durch die Prüfung des Beirats gegangen und haben es bei der Publikums-Abstimmung auf das Siegertreppchen geschafft. </p>
